<b>The Manager has appeared!</b>

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:51.870
<b>Fight
Defend
Magic
Escape</b>

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:51.870
<b>Normal Attack
Special Technique</b>

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:52.290
<b>The manager summoned help.</b>

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:53.580
Do you have to fight the 
manager in this game?!

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:54.920
And isn't this the same manager?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.130
<b>Part-timer A has appeared.
Part-timer B has appeared.
Part-timer C has appeared.
Part-timer D has appeared.</b>

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.420
It's the same manager!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:58.630
And why are you with them?!

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:00.900
Now they must defeat Part-timers 
A, C, the last boss,

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:04.170
and D before Part-timer B can 
become a full-time employee!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.140
Who gives a damn about Part-timer B?!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.740
Only one couple remains!

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:11.390
Will they be able to achieve victory?!

00:13:11.610 --> 00:13:13.300
C-Can we just skip this?

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:14.960
We're the only ones left.

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:16.080
We should advance by default.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.150
Oh, what's this?!

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:21.780
Why are the finalists here?!

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.210
H-Huh?

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:25.910
We've gotten lost in a strange place.

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:26.970
I'm sorry!

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:28.280
Let's turn back.

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:30.330
Yes.

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:34.720
Then I'll make sure you don't 
get lost by holding your hand.

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:35.290
Huh?

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:36.960
But Momo-san...

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:37.810
This way is...

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:41.240
Shinpachi-kun, you see...

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:44.660
As long as I'm with you, I'm never lost.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:46.680
No,

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:49.580
as long as I'm with you...

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:53.810
Let's get lost together.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.520
The sign!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.630
That's the sign!

00:13:57.630 --> 00:14:00.640
Shimura has barged into 
the Pinko-chan contest

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:03.570
and taken an insurmountable lead!

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.160
Huh?

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.120
We've gotten lost in a strange place.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:10.120
Then I'll make sure you don't get lost.

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:10.620
Hey.

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:13.490
Who gave you permission 
to walk in front of me?

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:17.960
Master, I have followed 
every one of your orders

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:22.290
because it made me happy.

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:22.960
But...

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:26.840
I want to make you happy!

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:28.260
I...

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:29.950
Bubera!

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:34.970
...want to grind my heels 
into this filthy pig!

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:36.040
Huh?

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.910
Such a stupid pig.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:41.980
Your weak admonishments no 
longer do anything for me!

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:46.820
I'm going to teach you true 
pain and pleasure, boy!

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:48.420
The sign!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:51.490
We don't know what kind of sign it is, but 
Sayaka-chan has given some kind of sign!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.030
Oh! Shimura is also joined by Okita

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:58.090
with a newly awakened Sayaka-chan 
as they step inside!

00:14:58.090 --> 00:14:59.600
What's going on?!

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:03.130
Are they going to leave the Pinko-chan team 
behind and enter the finals alone?!

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:06.640
What are you doing, Joe?!

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:08.420
The bell has rung!

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:10.590
Seriously, what's wrong with him?

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:11.430
He should make himself scarce.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:13.700
Nobody wants to see Pinko!

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:14.930
Get lost!

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:23.200
Go home! Go home! Go home!

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:25.860
Stand! Stand up, Joe!

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:27.450
The only one who can 
save Shinpachi-kun...

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:29.700
The only one who can defeat 
Sogo and avenge me...

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:32.200
The only one who can 
protect Pinko-chan...

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.190
...is you, her boyfriend!

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:39.650
Teach them the true meaning of 
a boyfriend, a girlfriend...

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:40.870
Of love!

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:42.040
Now stand!

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:45.880
Stand up, Joe!

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:55.380
Hey, you knocked off my kerchief.

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:56.510
Th-That's...

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:58.330
I-Impossible...

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:00.200
Who...

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:04.430
...is that?!

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:06.520
Who is she?

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:10.070
That should be obvious.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.180
She's my Pinko.

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:14.120
Let me go!

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:15.090
No way!

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.830
What's happened?!

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:18.540
Wh-What is this?

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:21.540
He's finally woken up.

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:23.190
There are times when a grown-up

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.040
doesn't have the option 
to request a change.

00:16:25.530 --> 00:16:29.550
There are times when a grown-up 
has no choice but to stand erect.

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:33.880
If virgins create illusions 
to escape from reality,

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:36.980
grown-ups create illusions 
to fight against reality.

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:41.310
Yes, illusions that are 
capable of altering reality!

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:42.960
Love.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:45.880
Th-That's not funny!

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:48.400
I'm not your woman!

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:52.090
I already said that I'm 
gonna avenge En-<i>beep</i>-ri!

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:55.340
Oh, it appears that Pinko-chan 
hasn't changed on the inside!

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:55.990
Die!

00:16:57.510 --> 00:17:02.140
Mom, that's not helping, okay?

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:04.460
En-<i>beep</i>-ri has also transformed!

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:06.610
I'm sorry, Sakata-san.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:11.080
My mom needed to vent her grief 
on someone after losing me!

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:14.000
Except you're still talking!

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:18.640
But the truth is that she appreciates 
that you were always there for her...

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:20.900
Hey, what are you saying?

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:24.020
I was just tailing him.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:27.930
And it wasn't because 
I like you or anything!

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:30.980
I did it so I could kill you 
whenever I wanted!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:32.820
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:35.500
I don't like you at all!

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:38.490
Mom, I never said that you liked him.

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:48.000
A-A tsundere?!

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:49.780
What?!

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:53.250
How can such a worn-out genre 
feel new and refreshing?!

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:57.460
The impact of her tsun was doubled 
because she was originally Pinko!

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:59.850
The result is that the impact 
of her dere is also double!

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:03.520
I just want you to be happy.

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:08.010
You shouldn't have to bear the burden 
of a son who isn't even your own.

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:11.770
You haven't been able to live 
the life of a young girl.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.250
I am your father's wife.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:17.010
It doesn't matter if he's dead.

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:19.590
Your relatives forced 
you into that marriage.

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:21.740
You never even held hands with Dad.

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:24.660
Wh-What's that?!

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:25.920
Impossible!

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:30.130
A widow with a son, and 
she's miraculously pure?!

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:33.300
But Tak-<i>beep</i>-zo was kind to me.

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:36.290
Yes, Dad cared deeply for you.

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:39.510
That's why he's wishing for 
your happiness from up above.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:42.050
Pinko, go do it!

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:46.060
Tak-<i>beep</i>-zo has given his permission?!

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:49.220
I-I guess I don't have a choice.

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:50.990
If Tak-<i>beep</i>-zo insists...

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:54.300
I don't want to do this, but 
I guess I'll go with you...

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:56.330
But don't get the wrong idea.

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:59.370
I-I'm not the kind of girl who would

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:03.380
come to a place like this 
with a man I don't like!

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.580
There it is!

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:13.040
Sakata has shown us the power 
of an awakened Pinko-chan

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.800
and gone inside!

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:17.800
An illusion to fight 
against reality is love?!

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:23.550
My ideal girlfriend will never lose 
to a grown-up's disgusting fantasy!

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:25.510
Isn't that right, Okita-san?!

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:29.210
Okita-san?! Okita-san!

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:33.810
Love isn't all it's cracked up to be!

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:35.740
Just you watch!

00:19:35.740 --> 00:19:37.940
My love with Momo-san is eternal!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.860
This is the end!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.490
<b>The manager has appeared.</b>

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.620
Why is the manager here?!

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:46.930
Well, we can't actually 
show what happens next,

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:48.250
so we'll use the manager instead.

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:50.620
That only makes it worse!

00:19:50.970 --> 00:19:54.960
The final battle will be a contest 
to send the manager to heaven!

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:57.000
Managetris!

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.510
What's that supposed to be?!

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:01.840
After all that, I have 
to face the manager?!

00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:03.850
Shimura has made mistake after mistake!

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:05.390
He can't mask his frustration?!

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:06.760
Damn! Damn!

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:10.730
Oh, and here comes the penalty!

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:12.950
A rain of managers!

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:13.520
This is...

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:15.520
Sakata!

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:20.370
He's calmly sending managers to 
heaven as though nothing happened!

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:23.240
Y-You don't love your 
girlfriend, Gin-san!

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:25.030
So it doesn't matter if her 
appearance has changed!

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:26.910
That's true.

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:32.160
But is it love in your case 
if you're so easily disturbed?

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:36.840
Women aren't going to follow 
the script like in a game.

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:40.130
The hottest girl around 
will still fart and poop.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:42.420
Eventually, she'll age and 
become an ugly manager.

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:44.730
Uh, she won't turn into the manager!

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:49.020
If you love someone, that means 
you're ready to accept that.

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:56.760
Love is the resolve to create an 
illusion that accepts this reality.

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:59.650
When you love a cold machine...

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:05.420
If you can't show affection for 
the manager, humans, reality,

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:07.450
you have no right to speak of love!

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:10.080
This is my love!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:13.620
56 straight Pinkos!

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:16.890
There it is!

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:23.470
<b>Winner      Loser</b>

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:18.550
The manager has gone!

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:20.260
It's over!

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:23.900
Sakata has shown the virgins 
what adult love is about!

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:26.470
Stand up, Shinpachi.

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.370
It's not over.

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:31.470
This is a new beginning for you all.

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:35.730
If you were able to pour 
this much love into a game,

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:39.980
I'm sure that you'll be able 
to love a real person one day.

00:21:40.220 --> 00:21:41.600
Gin-san...

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:46.120
That means you need to stop 
playing games and face reality.

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:47.380
Uh, well...

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:50.570
You're the one who 
needs to face reality.

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:55.910
Most people wouldn't take 
off their underwear.

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:55.910
Gin-san! Over here!

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:58.360
We were on the verge of becoming him?

00:21:58.360 --> 00:21:59.960
We need to wake up.

00:22:01.830 --> 00:22:05.370
Okay, I need to increase my 
boyfriend level so I can go

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:07.070
on a trip to Atami next weekend.

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:09.970
<b>Game Over</b>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:44.980
<b>It Would Take Too Much Effort to Make 
This Title Sound Like a Text Message Subject</b>

00:23:40.490 --> 00:23:41.260
Next time:

00:23:41.260 --> 00:23:44.980
It would take too much effort to make 
this title sound like a text message subject.
